msgid "TypeScript and Java SDKs: install, connect to the Testnet, sign and broadcast."
msgstr "TypeScriptとJava SDK:インストール、Testnetに接続し、署名して放送します。"

#: ../../04_building-apps/index.md:56
msgid "Connect dApps to Cubensis Connect and sign transactions on behalf of users."
